WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.985 --> 00:00:15.366
stared at Waldo, who was now a cow.

2
00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:20.068
Meanwhile, the pink monster ran back toward the soccer field.

3
00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:25.510
The teachers were still trying to catch the spider.

4
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.301
"Whoa!" shouted Mr.

5
00:00:34.341 --> 00:00:37.621
Freaky as the pink monster accidentally knocked him over.

6
00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:40.522
Mr. Freaky climbed back to his feet.

7
00:00:41.102 --> 00:00:44.763
Then—shloomp! Ben floated straight through the principal.

8
00:00:44.783 --> 00:00:47.084
"Ouch!" cried Mr.

9
00:00:47.144 --> 00:00:49.305
Freaky. "What's going on here?"

10
00:00:49.325 --> 00:00:53.706
"That pink monster is the one who's trying to ruin today's field trip!"

11
00:00:54.246 --> 00:00:55.746
Ben shouted over his shoulder.

12
00:00:55.766 --> 00:00:57.807
"Oh no!"

13
00:00:58.287 --> 00:00:59.227
cried the principal.

14
00:00:59.247 --> 00:01:01.088
"We have to catch her!"

15
00:01:01.924 --> 00:01:06.147
Mr. Freaky ran after the monster, and other teachers joined in the chase.

16
00:01:07.407 --> 00:01:10.489
Mr. Gwarg ran fast and tried to grab the monster.

17
00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:14.992
Suddenly—poof! There was a puff of smoke, and Mr.

18
00:01:15.072 --> 00:01:16.353
Gwarg was blown backward.

19
00:01:17.574 --> 00:01:19.815
The monster turned blue and got away.

20
00:01:21.816 --> 00:01:27.720
Miss Bungle had nearly grabbed the monster's hood when bright light flashed and the monster disappeared.

21
00:01:28.576 --> 00:01:32.679
When the monster reappeared farther down the field, she was a green ogre.

22
00:01:32.699 --> 00:01:36.321
"This is a disaster!"

23
00:01:36.742 --> 00:01:37.322
cried Mr.

24
00:01:37.382 --> 00:01:41.625
Freaky. Just then Ben heard the sound of rushing wind.

25
00:01:42.525 --> 00:01:47.048
He looked up and saw Winnie on her broom, ripping through the sky like a rocket.

26
00:01:47.849 --> 00:01:50.911
The witch weaved in and out of the crowd and toward the spider.

27
00:01:52.072 --> 00:01:55.714
The spider shot webs at Winnie, but she caught them with one hand.

28
00:01:56.535 --> 00:02:02.102
She flew in a circle around the spider, letting one strand of web wrap around the creature's legs.

29
00:02:03.283 --> 00:02:05.844
The spider fell over, unable to move.

30
00:02:06.905 --> 00:02:10.647
Next Winnie shot across the field, toward the green ogre.

31
00:02:11.887 --> 00:02:15.709
The ogre tried to run away, but Winnie flew like lightning.

32
00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:19.031
She flung the web and the ogre was caught.

33
00:02:24.474 --> 00:02:25.755
flying, Winnie!"

34
00:02:26.275 --> 00:02:27.156
said Miss Bungle.

35
00:02:28.068 --> 00:02:28.928
Winnie beamed.

36
00:02:30.029 --> 00:02:31.829
Everybody ran over to the ogre.

37
00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:38.371
Ben noticed that she was starting to change shape again.

38
00:02:38.851 --> 00:02:39.711
She grew thinner.

39
00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:42.392
Long black hair grew from her head.

40
00:02:44.513 --> 00:02:46.633
Everybody gasped.

41
00:02:46.653 --> 00:02:49.334
"Deb!" cried Mog.

42
00:02:49.354 --> 00:02:51.374
"Deb?" Mr.

43
00:02:51.454 --> 00:02:52.575
Freaky stared at her.

44
00:02:52.595 --> 00:02:56.716
"I don't understand.

45
00:02:57.552 --> 00:03:00.014
Why were you trying to ruin the people's visit?"

46
00:03:01.415 --> 00:03:02.456
Deb hung her head.

47
00:03:02.476 --> 00:03:05.198
"I wasn't trying to ruin it.

48
00:03:06.539 --> 00:03:09.661
But when the humans arrived, I started feeling weird.

49
00:03:10.762 --> 00:03:12.964
Then strange magic kept happening.

50
00:03:16.486 --> 00:03:20.609
I tried to talk to Waldo in the lab, but he didn't even recognize me.

51
00:03:21.390 --> 00:03:23.992
When I saw my reflection, I knew why."

52
00:03:26.888 --> 00:03:28.489
"That human was you?"

53
00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:29.590
said Waldo.

54
00:03:30.631 --> 00:03:31.371
Deb nodded.

55
00:03:31.391 --> 00:03:35.394
"I turned back into myself for a while.

56
00:03:36.275 --> 00:03:38.636
But then I turned into a bunch of other monsters."

57
00:03:41.058 --> 00:03:41.959
She looked at Mrs.

58
00:03:42.019 --> 00:03:45.281
Germ. "Why is this happening to me?"

59
00:03:47.863 --> 00:03:49.584
Mrs. Germ held out a hand.

60
00:03:49.604 --> 00:03:51.946
"Come to my office, dear.

61
00:03:52.566 --> 00:03:54.568
We'll get this all sorted out."

62
00:04:07.512 --> 00:04:12.716
The next day Ben was sitting with his friends at lunch.

63
00:04:13.696 --> 00:04:14.877
Mog and Deb were there.

64
00:04:15.998 --> 00:04:17.679
Gaby and Waldo were there too.

65
00:04:18.419 --> 00:04:20.201
Waldo wasn't a cow anymore.

66
00:04:21.201 --> 00:04:24.283
"Luckily the spell didn't last long," said the wizard.

67
00:04:24.303 --> 00:04:27.245
"I was back to normal by dinner."

68
00:04:30.047 --> 00:04:32.509
Winnie came over to the table and sat down.

69
00:04:32.529 --> 00:04:35.511
"When are you retaking your test?"

70
00:04:35.831 --> 00:04:36.512
Ben asked her.

71
00:04:37.736 --> 00:04:38.817
Winnie shook her head.

72
00:04:38.837 --> 00:04:41.198
"I'm not retaking the test."

73
00:04:41.218 --> 00:04:44.100
"What?" Ben was alarmed.

74
00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.881
"Why aren't you retaking it?"

75
00:04:47.122 --> 00:04:47.962
Winnie grinned.

76
00:04:47.982 --> 00:04:52.024
"Miss Bungle said that my flying yesterday was the best she's ever seen.

77
00:04:52.044 --> 00:04:56.547
I earned my broom flying license!"

78
00:04:57.868 --> 00:04:59.789
"Awesome!" said Ben.

79
00:05:00.589 --> 00:05:02.270
Waldo gave her a high five.

80
00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.572
"I have some news too."

81
00:05:05.216 --> 00:05:08.978
Deb, who'd been sitting silently with the group, suddenly spoke up.

82
00:05:09.878 --> 00:05:10.938
They all looked at her.

83
00:05:12.459 --> 00:05:13.780
Deb's voice shook a little.

84
00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:17.241
"I found out yesterday that I'm not a ghoul.

85
00:05:18.021 --> 00:05:19.102
I'm a doppelganger.

86
00:05:20.322 --> 00:05:22.283
I was adopted when I was really young.

87
00:05:23.263 --> 00:05:27.665
Since everyone else in my family is a ghoul, I took on that form at first.

88
00:05:28.566 --> 00:05:30.586
My parents had no idea either."

89
00:05:30.606 --> 00:05:34.068
"Wow," Winnie murmured softly.

90
00:05:34.588 --> 00:05:35.408
"That's big."

91
00:05:35.428 --> 00:05:39.630
"You never changed form until yesterday?"

92
00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:40.951
asked Waldo.

93
00:05:40.971 --> 00:05:43.232
"Nope," said Deb.

94
00:05:43.252 --> 00:05:45.713
"I didn't understand what was happening.

95
00:05:47.053 --> 00:05:48.734
I also have magic powers.

96
00:05:49.394 --> 00:05:50.715
They kept going crazy.

97
00:05:51.875 --> 00:05:54.297
I'm so sorry about everything that happened."

98
00:05:54.317 --> 00:05:57.878
"It sounds pretty scary," Ben said.

99
00:05:58.959 --> 00:06:02.080
He was always worried about learning how to float through objects.

100
00:06:02.752 --> 00:06:06.634
But his problem seemed silly compared to what Deb had gone through the day before.

101
00:06:08.936 --> 00:06:10.617
Deb was still explaining things.

102
00:06:10.637 --> 00:06:15.139
"Mrs. Germ thinks that being close to the humans caused my change.

103
00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.921
Doppelgangers like to make themselves look like humans.

104
00:06:20.642 --> 00:06:25.485
So when I was near humans for the first time yesterday, everything started happening."

105
00:06:28.707 --> 00:06:30.548
She looked like she might start crying.

106
00:06:32.132 --> 00:06:34.533
"It doesn't matter," Mog said quickly.

107
00:06:34.553 --> 00:06:39.175
"Ghoul, doppelganger Either way, you're perfect, Deb.

108
00:06:40.015 --> 00:06:48.099
You're so smart and "Oh boy," Ben whispered to Winnie as Mog went on and on about how

109
00:06:48.199 --> 00:06:49.199
great Deb was.

110
00:06:49.219 --> 00:06:51.140
"I know."

111
00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.580
Winnie grinned at Ben.

112
00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:55.962
"It sounds like somebody is totally in love again!"

113
00:06:55.982 --> 00:07:00.964
"Yeah," Ben thought, gazing into Winnie's pretty green eyes.

114
00:07:03.228 --> 00:07:03.755
"I am."
